/* Link AI：严格对齐 X / Grok 风格 —— 顶栏胶囊左侧双图标 + 无框通栏 AI 回复 + 横滑校规胶囊 + 半屏历史抽屉 + 悬浮胶囊输入框。 */
.ai-header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #eff3f4; }
.ai-head-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
.ai-head-btn {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 32px;
  min-width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: transparent;
}
.ai-head-btn:active { background: #eff3f4; }
.ai-head-btn image { width: 19px; height: 19px; }

.ai-page { padding: 12px 16px calc(188px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); background: #fff; min-height: 75vh; box-sizing: border-box; }
.ai-test-notice { margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e1e8ed; border-radius: 10px; background: #f7f9f9; color: #33444f; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; }
.ai-demo-pill {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #f7f9f9;
  color: #536471;
  font-size: 12px;
}

/* 访客居中引导 */
.ai-guest {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 96px 24px 0;
  text-align: center;
}
.ai-guest-icon {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 52px;
  height: 52px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: #eff3f4;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.ai-guest-icon image { width: 26px; height: 26px; }
.ai-guest-title { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f1419; line-height: 28px; }
.ai-guest-copy { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; color: #536471; }
.ai-guest-btn {
  margin-top: 22px !important;
  padding: 0 28px;
  height: 42px;
  border-radius: 21px;
  background: #0f1419;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 42px;
}

/* 空会话欢迎区 */
.ai-hero { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 88px 24px 0; text-align: center; }
.ai-hero-badge {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: #0f1419;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.ai-hero-icon { width: 24px; height: 24px; }
.ai-hero-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f1419; line-height: 28px; }
.ai-hero-sub { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #536471; }

/* 多轮对话 */
.ai-row { display: flex; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.ai-row--me { justify-content: flex-end; }
.ai-bubble--me {
  max-width: 82%;
  padding: 10px 15px;
  border-radius: 20px 20px 6px 20px;
  background: #eff3f4;
}
.ai-text {
  display: block;
  color: #0f1419;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 23px;
  white-space: pre-wrap;
  word-break: break-word;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.ai-answer-block { margin-bottom: 24px; }
.ai-answer-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.ai-avatar {
  flex: none;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #0f1419;
}
.ai-avatar image { width: 13px; height: 13px; }
.ai-answer-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f1419; }
.ai-answer-text { line-height: 24px; }

/* 校规来源横滑胶囊 */
.ai-sources-scroll { display: flex; white-space: nowrap; margin-top: 12px; }
.ai-source-pill {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  flex: none;
  height: 30px;
  margin-right: 8px !important;
  padding: 0 12px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  border: 1px solid #eff3f4;
  background: #f7f9f9;
  color: #536471;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 28px;
}
.ai-source-pill:active { background: #eff3f4; }
.ai-source-icon { width: 13px; height: 13px; flex: none; opacity: 0.7; }
.ai-source-title { color: #0f1419; font-weight: 600; }
.ai-source-meta { color: #536471; }

/* X 引用推文样式帖卡 */
.ai-quote-list { margin-top: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.ai-quote-card {
  border: 1px solid #cfd9de;
  border-radius: 16px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #fff;
}

/* 思考中动画 */
@keyframes grokPulse {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(0.92); }
  50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.06); }
}
.ai-thinking { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 0 16px; color: #536471; font-size: 14px; }
.ai-thinking-dot {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #eff3f4;
  animation: grokPulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.ai-thinking-dot image { width: 13px; height: 13px; }

/* 错误重试卡片 */
.ai-error-card {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
  margin: 12px 0;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: #fff5f5;
  border: 1px solid #fecaca;
}
.ai-error-copy { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.ai-error-title { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #b91c1c; }
.ai-error-desc { display: block; margin-top: 2px; font-size: 12px; color: #991b1b; }
.ai-error-retry {
  flex: none;
  height: 30px;
  padding: 0 14px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  background: #0f1419;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 30px;
}
.ai-bottom { height: 1px; }

/* 历史会话半屏抽屉 */
.ai-sheet-mask {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 200;
  background: rgba(15, 20, 25, 0.38);
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
}
.ai-sheet {
  width: 100%;
  max-height: 70vh;
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 26px 26px 0 0;
  padding: 10px 16px calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.ai-sheet-handle { width: 36px; height: 4px; border-radius: 2px; background: #cfd9de; margin: 0 auto 14px; }
.ai-sheet-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.ai-sheet-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f1419; }
.ai-sheet-new {
  height: 32px;
  padding: 0 14px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: #0f1419;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 32px;
}
.ai-sheet-list { max-height: 50vh; }
.ai-sheet-empty { padding: 36px 0; text-align: center; color: #536471; font-size: 14px; }
.ai-session-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  border-radius: 14px;
}
.ai-session-row--active { background: #f7f9f9; }
.ai-session-open {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  text-align: left;
  background: transparent;
}
.ai-session-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0f1419; flex: none; }
.ai-session-title {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #0f1419;
}
.ai-session-del {
  flex: none;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  color: #536471;
  font-size: 12px;
  background: transparent;
}
.ai-session-del:active { background: #fff0f2; color: #f4212e; }

/* 底部推荐卡片 + Grok 悬浮胶囊输入框 */
.ai-compose {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  z-index: 30;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  padding: 8px 14px 10px;
  background: #fff;
}
.ai-suggest-grid {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.ai-suggest-card {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  width: calc(50% - 4px);
  padding: 10px 12px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: #f7f9f9;
  border: 1px solid #eff3f4;
  text-align: left;
}
.ai-suggest-card:active { background: #eff3f4; }
.ai-suggest-card-title {
  display: block;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #0f1419;
  line-height: 18px;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.ai-suggest-card-sub {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #536471;
  line-height: 16px;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.ai-input-pill {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 6px 6px 6px 16px;
  border-radius: 24px;
  background: #f7f9f9;
  border: 1px solid #e6ecf0;
}
.ai-input {
  flex: 1;
  width: 0;
  min-height: 36px;
  max-height: 120px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 8px 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: #0f1419;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 20px;
}
.ai-send {
  flex: none;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 36px;
  min-width: 36px;
  max-width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  padding: 0;
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: #0f1419;
}
.ai-send image { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
.ai-send--idle { opacity: 0.35; }

@media (min-width: 500px) {
  .ai-page, .ai-compose, .ai-sheet { max-width: 460px; margin: 0 auto; }
}
